  "findings": [
    "Tag normalization used lower instead of casefold in all three interfaces; successful self-checks missed the Unicode defect.",
    "Duration typed actions repeatedly contained duplicate text keys. Constraints avoided that JSON defect, but the resulting parser still violated whitespace, case and ASCII-digit requirements.",
    "Typed query solving repeated empty checks; constrained query solving repeated truncated test payloads. Fenced returned a functional fallback patch without tested REPL completion.",
    "Fenced severity passed meaningful parent assertions and grading but did not delegate. Both typed children failed assertions, repeated unchanged checks and returned no completed proposal.",
    "Both typed range children returned correctly graded patches after meaningful checks. Neither parent applied the proposal and completed a matching successful check; no child pre-repair failing assertion was observed. Constrained parent tests contradicted required adjacent merging.",
    "Flag children used the wrong per-key default and repeated the same failing assertions. Final typed parent checks were truncated. Fenced repeatedly read without printing and returned a failing fallback patch."
  ],
